="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">DISTINCT</span><span> CITY
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">FROM</span><span> STATION
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">WHERE</span><span> CITY </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">NOT</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">REGEXP</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">'^[AEIOUaeiou]'</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>   </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">OR</span><span> CITY </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">NOT</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">REGEXP</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">'[AEIOUaeiou]$'</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Breaking it down:</strong></p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Condition</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">CITY NOT REGEXP '^[AEIOUaeiou]'</code></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Does <strong>not</strong> start with a vowel</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">OR</code></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Either condition is enough</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">CITY NOT REGEXP '[AEIOUaeiou]$'</code></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Does <strong>not</strong> end with a vowel</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Key difference from previous query:</strong></p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Query</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Logic</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Previous</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">NOT (starts AND ends with vowel)</code> → NOT REGEXP with <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.*</code></td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">This one</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">NOT starts</code> <strong>OR</strong> <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">NOT ends</code> with vowel</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Using <strong>OR</strong> means a city is included if <strong>either</strong> condition is true — so even if a city starts with a vowel but doesn't end with one, it still appears in the result. ✅</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Alternative cleaner way:</strong></p>
<div role="group" aria-label="sql code" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
