="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">DISTINCT</span><span> CITY
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">FROM</span><span> STATION
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">WHERE</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">NOT</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span>CITY </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">REGEXP</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">'^[AEIOUaeiou]'</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">AND</span><span> CITY </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">REGEXP</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">'[AEIOUaeiou]$'</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Both queries return the <strong>same result</strong> — by De Morgan's Law:</p>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">NOT A OR NOT B</code> = <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">NOT (A AND B)</code> ✅</p>
