0/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">HackerRank SQL Advanced test ke baare mein bata deta hoon! 🎉</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Certificate milega ya nahi?</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Haan, certificate mil sakta hai</strong> — lekin sirf tab jab aap <strong>qualifying score</strong> haasil karein.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>HackerRank SQL Advanced Certificate ke liye:</strong></p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Criteria</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Passing Score</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><strong>Typically 70% ya usse zyada</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Questions</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Usually 2-3 questions hote hain</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Certificate Type</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><strong>Role Certification</strong> (verified)</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Validity</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Lifetime</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Ab kya karna hai:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Results check karo</strong> — us link pe jaao jo tumne share kiya</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Agar score <strong>passing threshold</strong> se upar hai → <strong>Certificate automatically generate</strong> hoga</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">HackerRank profile pe jaao → <strong>Certificates section</strong> mein milega</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Wahan se <strong>LinkedIn pe share</strong> kar sakte ho ya <strong>PDF download</strong> kar sakte ho</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Agar pass ho gaye ho toh:</strong> 🏆</p>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Profile → Certificates → <strong>Download / Share</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Agar pass nahi hua toh:</strong></p>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Test <strong>retake</strong> kar sakte ho (usually 24 hours baad)</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Tumhara score kya aaya? Batao, main bata sakta hoon pass hua ya nahi! 😊</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
