amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Agar tumne dono questions solve karke submit kar diye, toh <strong>chances bahut ache hain!</strong> 🎉</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Ab kya hoga:</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">HackerRank automatically evaluate karta hai — agar test pass hua toh:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Email aayega</strong> certificate ka link lekar</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Ya seedha us link pe jaao jo tumne share kiya — wahan <strong>score aur result</strong> dikh raha hoga</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Profile ke <strong>Certificates section</strong> mein appear ho jaayega</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Lekin yaad rakho</strong> — sirf submit karna kaafi nahi, <strong>test cases pass</strong> hone chahiye. Matlab:</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Condition</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Saare/zyada test cases pass ✅</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Certificate milega</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Kam test cases pass ❌</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Score low hoga, certificate nahi milega</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Jaldi check karo:</strong></p>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Us link pe jaao → dekho kitna <strong>score</strong> show ho raha hai</p>
</blockquote>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Score batao mujhe</strong> — main confirm kar dunga certificate milega ya nahi! 😊</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
