.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Haan, retake kar sakte ho!</strong> ✅</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>HackerRank Retake Policy:</strong></p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Detail</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Info</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">⏳ Waiting Period</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><strong>6 months</strong> baad retake allowed hai</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">🔄 Attempts</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Limited attempts hote hain</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">📊 Best Score</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Sirf <strong>best score</strong> show hota hai profile pe</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>6 months bohot lamba lagta hai — toh ab kya karo?</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Pehle score check karo</strong> — shayad pass ho gaye ho! 😊</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Agar fail bhi hua toh <strong>6 months mein practice karo</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Is waqt <strong>SQL Advanced topics</strong> practice karo:
