iv]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Perfect! Ab sunो — <strong>1 hour daily + basics</strong> = <strong>3 months mein job ready!</strong> 💪</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🗓️ Tumhara Personal Roadmap</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold"><strong>Week 1-2 — Basics Solid Karo</strong></h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Jo pehle se aata hai usse <strong>pakka karo:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">SELECT, WHERE, ORDER BY</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">GROUP BY, HAVING</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">DISTINCT, LIMIT</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">👉 Practice: <strong>HackerRank SQL Easy problems</strong></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold"><strong>Week 3-4 — JOINs Master Karo</strong></h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Yeh sabse important hai interviews mein!</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">INNER JOIN, LEFT JOIN, RIGHT JOIN</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Multiple table joins</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Self JOIN</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">👉 Practice: <strong>HackerRank SQL Medium problems</strong></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold"><strong>Week 5-6 — Advanced Cheezein</strong></h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Subqueries</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">CASE WHEN</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Window Functions (<strong>ROW_NUMBER, RANK, LEAD, LAG</strong>)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">CTEs (WITH clause)</li>
</ul>
