<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🎯 HackerRank pe 2 tarah ke certificates hain:</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">1️⃣ <strong>Skills Certification Test</strong> ✅</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><em>(Jo tum aaj de chuki ho!)</em></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Yeh <strong>timed test</strong> hota hai</li>
