<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">2️⃣ <strong>Practice Problems</strong></h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><em>(Jo salary wala link tha)</em></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Yeh sirf <strong>practice</strong> ke liye hain</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Inhe solve karne se <strong>badges/stars</strong> milte hain</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Koi alag certificate nahi milta inse</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Yeh tumhari <strong>preparation</strong> ke liye hain!</li>
</ul>
