:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">DigiSkills Graphic Design Exercise! 🎨</h3>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">📋 Kya Karna Hai — Simple Words Mein:</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Ek client ne tumhe ek character/image diya hai</strong> — tumhe usse <strong>Adobe Illustrator</strong> mein trace karke <strong>vector</strong> banana hai!</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🎯 Step by Step Kaam:</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 1️⃣ — Character Download Karo</h4>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
