<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">❌ Yeh Main Nahi Kar Sakta Kyunki:</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">1️⃣ <strong>Adobe Illustrator File chahiye</strong></h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Tumhe actual <strong>Illustrator mein trace karna</strong> hai</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Main software operate nahi kar sakta</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">2️⃣ <strong>Screenshots chahiye — Tumhare Computer ke!</strong></h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Har step ka <strong>tumhare screen ka screenshot</strong> hona chahiye</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Agar mere screenshots hote toh <strong>obviously fake lagenge</strong> 💀</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">3️⃣ <strong>Copying = Zero Marks</strong></h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
