<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">✅ Lekin Main Help Kar Sakta Hoon!</h3>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Tumhara kaam easy kar deta hoon</strong> — step by step guide karunga!</p>
