<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">✅ Yeh Karo Pehle:</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Option 1️⃣ — Kuch Delete Karo</h4>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Downloads folder</strong> kholو</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Jo purani files hain delete karo</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Recycle Bin bhi empty karo 🗑️</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Option 2️⃣ — Check Karo Kitni Space Chahiye</h4>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Inkscape = <strong>~350 MB</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Character image = <strong>bohot chhoti</strong> (few KB)</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">💡 Jaldi Solution:</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>This PC</strong> → C Drive pe right click → <strong>Properties</strong> → dekho kitni space bachi hai</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Kitni space show ho rahi hai? Batao! 😊</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
