<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 3️⃣ — Inkscape Mein Image Open Karo</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Yeh karo:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Inkscape</strong> kholو</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>File → Open</strong> click karo</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Desktop se <strong>character image</strong> select karo</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Open</strong> click karo ✅</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Ab yeh important hai</strong> 📸</p>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Jaise hi image Inkscape mein khule —
<strong>Screenshot lo</strong> — yeh tumhara <strong>Step 1 screenshot</strong> hoga Word file ke liye!</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Screenshot kaise lete hain:</p>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Windows key + Shift + S</strong> dabao → screen select karo → screenshot save ho jaayega! 📸</p>
</blockquote>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
