<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5"></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 pl-2 py-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="group/status flex items-center gap-2 py-1 text-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer text-left text-text-500 hover:text-text-300 flex-1 min-w-0" aria-expanded="false"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 min-w-0" style="opacity: 1;"><span class="truncate text-sm font-base">Searched the web</span><span class="inline-flex transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0 -rotate-90"><div style="width: 12px; height: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M14.128 7.165a.502.502 0 0 1 .744.67l-4.5 5-.078.07a.5.5 0 0 1-.666-.07l-4.5-5-.06-.082a.501.501 0 0 1 .729-.656l.075.068L10 11.752z"></path></svg></div></span></div></button></div><span class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite">Searched the web</span><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out" style="grid-template-rows: 0fr;"><div class="overflow-hidden min-w-0"></div></div></div></div><div class="row-start-2 col-start-1 relative grid isolate min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 relative z-[2] min-w-0"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Yeh Karo! 😊</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Simplilearn Front End Development course complete karne ke baad certificate milta hai <span class="inline-flex" data-state="closed"><a href="https://www.simplilearn.com.cach3.com/front-end-developer-free-course-skillup.html" target="_blank" class="group/tag relative h-[18px] rounded-full inline-flex items-center overflow-hidden -translate-y-px cursor-pointer"><span class="relative transition-colors h-full max-w-[180px] overflow-hidden px-1.5 inline-flex items-center font-small rounded-full border-0.5 border-border-300 bg-bg-200 group-hover/tag:bg-accent-900 group-hover/tag:border-accent-100/60"><span class="text-nowrap text-text-300 break-all truncate font-normal group-hover/tag:text-text-200">Simplilearn.com</span></span><span class="transition-all opacity-[0%] h-[17px] absolute right-[0.5px] inline rounded-r-full flex items-center px-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-900/0 via-accent-900/100 via-30% to-accent-900/100 group-hover/tag:opacity-[100%]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="transition-all group-hover/tag:ease-out duration-[500ms] ease-in text-accent-100 group-hover/tag:scale-[100%] scale-[80%] group-hover/tag:opacity-[100%] opacity-[0%] -mr-[2px]"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"></path></svg></span></a></span> — but kabhi kabhi manually claim karna padta hai!</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step by Step:</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>1)</strong> Seedha is link pe jao:</p>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">🔗 <strong>simplilearn.com/skillup-free-online-courses</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>2)</strong> Login karo apne account se</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>3)</strong> <strong>"My Learning"</strong> ya <strong>"Dashboard"</strong> pe jao</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>4)</strong> Front End Development course dhundo</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>5)</strong> <strong>"Get Certificate"</strong> ya <strong>"Claim Certificate"</strong> button dhundo ✅</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Agar Phir Bhi Nahi Mila: 😅</h3>
<blockquote class="ml-2 border-l-4 border-border-300/10 pl-4 text-text-300">
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Profile</strong> → <strong>My Certificates</strong> section check karo</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Ya Simplilearn ka <strong>live chat support</strong> se poochho</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Unhe batao <strong>91% complete</strong> hai aur certificate nahi mila</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
